{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/pulls/21944","id":5006969229,"node_id":"PR_kwDODihR8s8AAAABKnBJjQ","html_url":"https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/pull/21944","diff_url":"https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/pull/21944.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale/pull/21944.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/issues/21944","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/pulls/21944/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/pulls/21944/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/issues/21944/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailscale/tailscale/statuses/dd5b34d7cc65dd7a6eed759bfe2390bde25f3dd3","number":21944,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ssh/tailssh: enforce SSH policy at the connection level","user":{"login":"raggi","id":348,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi","html_url":"https://github.com/raggi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raggi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Re-evaluate authenticated connections on policy updates and at session\nand forwarding gates. Close connections whose grants are revoked or\nnarrowed, including forwarding permissions, user identity, duration,\nAcceptEnv, and effective recording requirements. Recheck rule-derived\nAcceptEnv and recording configuration for delegated connections too.\n\nTreat recording-failure changes in either direction as material,\nincluding fail-open to fail-closed transitions. An inconclusive user\nlookup retains the previous identity but does not skip other policy\nchecks. An absent account revokes the connection.\n\nRe-arm rule-expiry timers under the policy recheck lock and prevent\nre-arming after teardown. Add connection-level login grace, extending\nit during delegation and stopping it only on SSH authentication\nsuccess, not on unsigned key queries or partial authentication.\nClose the raw transport and cancel delegated authentication on teardown.\n\nAdd regression tests for these transitions and remove scheduling\nassumptions from delegation tests.\n\nUpdates tailscale/corp#50380\n\nSigned-off-by: James Tucker <james@tailscale.com>","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T17:26:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:36:20Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"68f849799a470bba0f55f84916aa9e4b4e2062e0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"tailscale:raggi/ssh-22","ref":"raggi/ssh-22","repo":{"id":237523442,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyMzc1MjM0NDI=","name":"tailscale","full_name":"tailscale/tailscale","owner":{"login":"tailscale","id":48932923,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjQ4OTMyOTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48932923?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailscale","html_url":"https://github.com/tailscale","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailscale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailscale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailscale/gists{/gist_id}","sta